type: software
title: "AI-ASSIST: retrieval-based critical clearing time estimation with abstention"
abstract: "Retrieval-based estimator of transient-stability critical clearing times that abstains when the archive holds no topology-compatible state, with the data pipeline, evaluation scripts and the analysis scripts behind every reported number."
